      Morphologic Features.
PG  - e73830
LID - 10.1002/ccr3.73830 [doi]
LID - e73830
AB  - Recognition of the characteristic morphologic features of acute promyelocytic 
      leukemia on peripheral blood smear should prompt immediate initiation of 
      all-trans retinoic acid while awaiting confirmatory testing, as early 
      intervention is critical to reducing hemorrhagic mortality and improving clinical 
      outcomes.
