AB  - A pseudo-hyperkalemia may occur with hyperleukocytosis. It is important to 
      recognize it early to avoid unnecessary or even dangerous treatment inducing 
      hypokalemia. The pseudohyperkalemia is due to cell fragility coupled to 
      mechanical phenomena during blood collecting. We report a case of 
      pseudo-hyperkalemia in a context of acute myeloid leukemia.
