AB  - Diabetes insipidus and thrombocytosis were presenting symptoms in a case of adult 
      ANLL-M1. Cytogenetic investigations revealed a typical 3q rearrangement, i.e. 
      inv(3)(q21q26). A subclone with monosomy 7 was also found and documented by FISH 
      analysis. Correlations between clinical/hematological features and 
